.TH CHTTPSVR_REQ_RAW_QUERY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_req_raw_query \- return the raw query string of a request
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpserver.h>

const char *chttpsvr_req_raw_query(const chttpsvr_req *req);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns a NUL-terminated string containing the raw (un-decoded) query
string, without the leading '?'.  Returns NULL if no query string is
present.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_req_query (3),
.BR chttpsvr_req_query_one (3)
